        "content": "\nCurrent tests only cover `initialize()` and `save_query` + `get_query`. Missing:\n\n- `list_queries()` — multiple records, ordering by timestamp DESC\n- `save_agent_response()` + `get_agent_responses()` round-trip\n- `save_orchestrator_response()` + `get_orchestrator_response()` round-trip\n- `save_feedback()` + `get_feedback_for_query()` round-trip\n- `export_feedback()` — returns list of dicts\n- `get_cached()` — TTL expiry logic (fresh vs. expired SQL WHERE clause)\n- `get_stale()` — returns regardless of TTL\n- `set_cached()` + `clear_expired()` — row is deleted after expiry\n- `get_query()` with nonexistent ID returns `None`\n\n```python\n",
